{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographers' private lives (摄影师私生活).\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates have titles with patterns like \"主题：场景中的内容类型\". The content types include:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - matches interest well\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - matches interest well\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - matches interest\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about exhibitions, curator, author biography, art history - this is more about art viewing, less aligned\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - about camera purchase packages, promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is explicitly NOT wanted (器材促销)\n\nThe interest explicitly says: 关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活。\n\nSo I should avoid:\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - equipment promotions\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about exhibitions, author biography (摄影师私生活/art history)\n\nI should prefer:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles)\n- 操作记录 (operation records)\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n\nLet me count the candidates that match well. Let me identify the good candidates (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览).\n\nLet me scan through the list. There are 80 candidates exposed. I need to select 20.\n\nLet me categorize each candidate by its content type (the last part of description).\n\nLet me go through them:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d - 静物布光 市场观察 - EXCLUDE (market)\n2. item-03a565217024 - 运动追焦 专题观察 - EXCLUDE (exhibition/biography)\n3. item-03b7af37b88f - 逆光人像 条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e - 雨天反光 条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n5. item-061d97575247 - 夜景曝光 条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3 - 室内白平衡 专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n7. item-07bfbf16235d - 微距景深 市场观察 - E